<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Genop says to proceed with rights offer.</title>
<headline>Genop says to proceed with rights offer.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Optical Co Ltd said on Friday it would proceed with a rights offer to reduce debt and to finance further growth.</p>
<p>It did not say how much money would be raised in the offer but said a further announcement would be made around February 3.</p>
<p>Shares to be issued in terms of the offer would not participate in the interim dividend, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
